{ "status": "answered", "answer": "If Vyera undergoes a Change of Control, it will be subject to Section 2.6. This section states that Vyera may be required to terminate the development, manufacturing, commercialization, and other exploitation of certain products or terminate the Agreement. However, Vyera will not be in breach of this Section 2.6 during the 180-day Disposition Period if it complies with its obligations prior to the end of the period.",

